{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "GE5SIZXGXRQZW45BFMF67ZDPT6WZTVVY",
    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00001031025001",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "あの……さっきから、2人でなんだか……。\r\n私にご用でしょうか？",
            "enText": "Um… you two have just been standing \nthere… do you need something?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4581362038048610740,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ご、ごめんなさいぃ！",
            "enText": "I-I'm so sorryyy!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 8179482309052022162,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゼンノロブロイ",
            "enName": "Zenno Rob Roy",
            "jpText": "で、ですから、\r\nライスさんのせいじゃないですよ……！",
            "enText": "L-Like I said, it's not your fault!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 672241752506780219,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……ええっと……。\r\n私、何かされたんですか……？",
            "enText": "Um… did you… wrong me somehow?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 8857829319405207784,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゼンノロブロイ",
            "enName": "Zenno Rob Roy",
            "jpText": "……その。\r\nライスさんと2人で絵本を作ったんです。\nカフェさんのお誕生日プレゼントにって。",
            "enText": "Well, um… Rice and I made a picture book, \nas a birthday present for you.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 365715224218256811,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゼンノロブロイ",
            "enName": "Zenno Rob Roy",
            "jpText": "黒猫に乗ったカフェさんが、伝説のコーヒー\r\n豆を見つけるっていう素敵な絵本で。紙を\n綴る手前までは作れていたんですが――",
            "enText": "It had a nice story about you riding a black \ncat and finding legendary coffee beans. \nBut right as we were about to bind the book…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -3722529968332196377,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "でも、最後のページを失くしちゃって……！\r\nどこにも、見つからなくって……。\nごめんなさいっ、ライスのせいで……！",
            "enText": "The last page went missing! We looked \neverywhere but couldn't find it… \nSorry, it's all my fault!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -7725954854810927881,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "…………問題、ありません。\r\n最後のない絵本……ぜひ、いただきたいです。",
            "enText": "…That's okay. A picture book without \nan ending… sounds nice, actually.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -2827545313756642664,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "え……？　でも――",
            "enText": "Huh? But…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 7878705394875799638,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "みなさんを見ていると……見えない時ほど\r\n想像力は働くようです……。",
            "enText": "From what I can tell… it's the things we can't \nsee that stir our imaginations the most…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 7170716973193102393,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "ですから、最後のページがないというのは……\r\nよいエッセンスになっているのでは……と。",
            "enText": "So a missing last page… could make the story \neven more compelling…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -7484723111979525445,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "つまり、その……ありがとう、ございます。\r\nご用意、嬉しい……です。",
            "enText": "What I mean to say is… Thank you. \nI… appreciate your gift.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 9000042541929286195,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
    "humanTl": true,
    "modified": 1784218721
}